Here is a batch script that can be used to delete files:

```
@echo off
set /p confirm=Are you sure you want to delete these files? (y/n)
if /i "%confirm%"=="y" (
  for %%f in (*.*) do (
    del /q "%%f"
  )
) else (
  echo Deletion cancelled.
  pause
  exit
)
```

